            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A chromosome that encodes the nuclear genome and is found in the nucleus of a eukaryotic cell during the cell cycle phases when the nucleus is intact.</obo:IAO_0000115>
