        <obo:IAO_0000115>The chemical reactions and pathways resulting in the formation of a protein in the cytoplasm. This is a ribosome-mediated process in which the information in messenger RNA (mRNA) is used to specify the sequence of amino acids in the protein.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by>hjd</oboInOwl:created_by>
        <oboInOwl:creation_date>2011-06-09T03:11:53Z</oboInOwl:creation_date>
