        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0003824"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Catalysis of an oxidation-reduction (redox) reaction, a reversible chemical reaction in which the oxidation state of an atom or atoms within a molecule is altered. One substrate acts as a hydrogen or electron donor and becomes oxidized, while the other acts as hydrogen or electron acceptor and becomes reduced.</obo:IAO_0000115>
