    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0034330">
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A process that is carried out at the cellular level which results in the assembly, arrangement of constituent parts, or disassembly of a cell junction. A cell junction is a specialized region of connection between two cells or between a cell and the extracellular matrix.</obo:IAO_0000115>
